  "description": "T1: Self seeded multi stemmed small/medium-sized ash. Fell as close to ground level as possible. The tree has grown from inside a concrete wall at the intersection of 4 gardens. It's badly damaging the wall and adjoining walls also, touching nearby windows and is far too close to the properties. The multistem split is right at the base and the union isn't ideal, considering also that the root system must be very limited. The suggested specification is to fell as close to the wall as possible and poison the stump with a suitable herbicide to prevent regrowth.",
